
@startuml MazeCode
title C4 Level 4 - Code Diagram
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0

class Maze {
  +grid
  +start
  +goal
  +get_neighbors(node)
}

class SearchController {
  +solve_bfs(maze)
  +solve_dfs(maze)
}

class BFS {
  +queue
  +visited
  +search(start, goal)
}

class DFS {
  +stack
  +visited
  +search(start, goal)
}

class PathReconstructor {
  +reconstruct_path(parent, goal)
}

class ResultDisplay {
  +show_path(path)
  +show_steps(steps)
}

SearchController --> Maze
SearchController --> BFS
SearchController --> DFS
BFS --> Maze : Gets neighbors
DFS --> Maze : Gets neighbors
BFS --> PathReconstructor
DFS --> PathReconstructor
PathReconstructor --> ResultDisplay
@enduml
